# Sprint P3 (ADR-013 §6): the frontend's build output. Built directly
# into xedge/fleet/static/dashboard/ (see frontend/vite.config.ts) so a
# non-editable `pip install .` picks it up via hatchling's default
# package-data inclusion -- a build artifact either way, not meant to be
# committed, same as coverage.xml/htmlcov/ above.
xedge/fleet/static/dashboard/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

